{"id":"en_paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body","title":"Paris Designer in a Small Town Body","titleEn":"Paris Designer in a Small Town Body","description":"Chloe, a leading Paris designer, is killed in a car accident and awakens in 1995 inside the body of an overweight woman who shares her name in Raven Creek. That Chloe had been set up by her cousin Brad, was despised by the locals, and was on the verge of losing Ethan, a veteran. Drawing on her design skills and determination, Chloe loses weight, outmaneuvers lethal plots, launches a fashion label with Ethan, and sets her sights on Paris Fashion Week, though the town's hidden truths threaten to bring her down.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Female Empowerment","Love After Marriage","Time Travel","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsjq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsjq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsjq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsjq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_paris-designer-in-a-small-town-body_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sou